# ERNativeUI @PROJECT_VERSION@ Windows x64 package

This archive contains the ERNativeUI host, public C and C++ headers, CMake
package files, buildable examples, optional presentation assets, and tools.

The complete documentation remains online to avoid duplicating its large
screenshot library in every binary release:

[Open the documentation for ERNativeUI @PROJECT_VERSION@](https://github.com/Flammrock/ERNativeUI/blob/ERNativeUI-v@PROJECT_VERSION@/docs/README.md)

The URL is pinned to the `ERNativeUI-v@PROJECT_VERSION@` tag and therefore
matches the files in this archive.

Package layout:

- `bin` contains the runtime host, configuration, locales, optional GFX, tools,
  and built example DLLs.
- `include` contains the public header-only client API.
- `lib/cmake/ERNativeUI` contains the CMake package configuration.
- `share/ERNativeUI` contains source examples, notices, and licenses.
